# THE MAGAZINE (named by prep_wm.py from measured motion, not from the mesh's own label). THE AXIS IS MEASURED: no single slide or hinge fits the whole stroke (the magazine tilts as it leaves), so the axis is the direction its centre actually travelled by frame 0. Distance is its own length along that axis.
